Source and executables (remember to use binary on ftp transfers) for
a simple program to check whether your DEC5000/240 has serious problems with
double precision computations is now available for anonymous ftp at
vivace.msd.anl.gov (130.202.76.9) in pub/DECproblem. The executables
were compiled with cc version 2.1 and f77 version 3.2. 

