thanks goodness I have CMU/Tek on our VAXen with which I was able to ftp
the stuff from a DOS box (with Wollongong TCP/IP) to our VAXen.

If you're interested in my company's fixes to the Aspen code, I'm sure some
pecuniary arrangements can be finagled!  :-)

