keeps changing the drive mount plates *just enough* that one won't work with
the other.  We wanted to move some RZ23s from a VAXstation 3100/30 to some
DECstation 2100s and ended up having to buy new plates because the tabs were
in different locations and the holddown screw went from a threaded affair to
a push-and-lock type.

Consistency would be nice, guys!

