    I can't speak to the detailed technical specifications, but only from the
    layman's information I have.  I have been told that NIVC operation is only
    supported over three segments or fewer.  That is, there can't be more than
    two {repeater|bridge}s between any two of your VAXcluster nodes.

    I *think* this is documented somewhere (Digital's Ethernet Configuration
    Guide?).  In any event, the above bears out my experience - I've never
    been able to get an NIVC to work _reliably_ with nodes on more than three
    adjacent segments.

